#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. お、怒られちゃったね…
#. 機嫌悪かったのかな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"He really dug into us there. Maybe he's in a bad\n"
"mood..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>相当…落ち込んでるみたいだ…
#. さすがにショックだったのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She seems super depressed. Did he really upset her\n"
"that much?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 十神君…あんなに…
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Byakuya... To go that far..."
msgstr ""

#. …あたしの事心配してくれてたッ！
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "He must be r-really concerned about me!"
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしの事…心配してくれて……
#. お風呂に入れって…言ってくれたわッ！！
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"He told me t-to take a bath and everything. He must\n"
"really care a-about my well-being!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ねぇ、苗木…どうかしら？
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hey, M-Makoto...what do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. どうって…何が？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Think...about what?"
msgstr ""

#. あたしと十神君…うまくいくかしら…？
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Do you think B-Byakuya and I would be...g-good\n"
"together?"
msgstr ""

#. いや、ちょっと…わからないけど…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, well now...I-I don't really know."
msgstr ""

#. …そうね。わかるはずがないわね。
#. それが…真実よね…
msgctxt "0014 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "That's t-true. There's really no w-way to know..."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもね…恋に距離なんて関係ないのよ…！
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But the distance between u-us doesn't change our\n"
"love...!"
msgstr ""

#. 想った時にはすでに叶っている…
#. それが恋なんだから…！
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Because as soon as you realize your f-feelings,\n"
"the love is born. That's h-how love works!"
msgstr ""

#. そう…なんだ…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O...kay."
msgstr ""

#. あ、あなたにも…きっとわかる日が来るわ…
#. いつか…きっとね。
msgctxt "0018 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"There m-might come a day when y-you understand. Maybe.\n"
"S-Someday."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあね、さようなら…
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Well...bye."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 純愛ですなッ！！
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Ahh, young love!"
msgstr ""

#. うわッ！！
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Uwah!"
msgstr ""

#. しっかし、あの腐川さんが、
#. よりにもよって十神クンをねぇ…
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Who would've ever guessed she would go for someone\n"
"like him?"
msgstr ""

#. だけども一途な思いは怖いですよ！
#. 時に、人を間違った方向に進ませますからね！
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But eager passion can also be scary! Sometimes that\n"
"leads people off in the wrong direction!"
msgstr ""

#. にょほほほほほほーッ！！
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Nyooohohohoho!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. なんか…どっと疲れが…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "All of a sudden, I feel exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず…一旦部屋に戻ろうかな……
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe I'll head back to my room for now..."
msgstr ""
